<th id="S3.T1.2.7.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row ltx_border_t" style="padding:1.25pt 4.0pt;">QwenVL2.5-3B <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_cite"><a href="#bib.bib1" title="" class="ltx_ref">Bai et al. (2025)</a></cite></th>
<td id="S3.T1.2.7.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center ltx_border_t" style="padding:1.25pt 4.0pt;">21.2</td>
