<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 1: </span>Performance of Reflection-V across various visual reasoning benchmarks, compared to existing VLMs. <math id="S3.T1.m20" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\dagger" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>†</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\dagger</annotation></semantics></math> indicates results reproduced by us. <math id="S3.T1.m21" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\diamond" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⋄</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\diamond</annotation></semantics></math> denotes vision-language reasoning Models also based on the Qwen2.5-7B series. Bold and underlined scores represent the best and second-best performance among open-source models for each benchmark.</figcaption>
</figure>
