<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Data Resources</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We collect data from a large multimodal corpus for (1) constructing reasoning data with visual reflection pattern (cold-start initialization stage) and (2) GRPO training, as summarized in Tables X and Y.</p>
</div>
