<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Case Study</h2>

<figure id="A5.F8" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.12132v1/case1.png" id="A5.F8.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:476/594;" width="476" height="594" alt="Refer to caption">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 8: </span>Case study 1 for our model, Reflection-V, performs visual reflection during visual reasoning. In this case, based on rechecking the image, Reflection-V reveals key visual information which is not in the generated reasoning context, therefore finally infers the correct answer.
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A5.F9" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.12132v1/case2.png" id="A5.F9.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_portrait" style="aspect-ratio:476/652;" width="476" height="652" alt="Refer to caption">
